  is always allowed.

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

5. Delayed publication schedule

  The Licensor ships major versions of Suisei by year name (for
  example, version "2027"). When a version N is released, the
  Licensor publishes the previous year's final development snapshot,
  tagged "(N-1)dev" (for example, "2026dev"), as the Released Version
  of Suisei. Only that delayed snapshot is governed by this License;
  the released version N itself and all later development remain
  closed and are Unreleased Versions.

  The Licensor may, at its sole discretion, publish additional
  versions earlier or later than this schedule, or not at all, and
  may adopt a different licence for future releases. Each Released
  Version is governed by the licence in effect at the time it is
  published.

──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

