      restricts Your use, sharing, or distribution of User Works.

  (b) Independent Works are not Derivative Works of Suisei solely by
      reason of communicating or interoperating with Suisei through a
      documented public interface. You may develop, publish, and
      distribute Independent Works under terms of Your own choosing,
